    cat << EOF
FINN Container Management

Usage: $0 COMMAND [OPTIONS]

Commands:
    init           Start persistent container in background
    exec CMD       Execute command in running container
    shell          Interactive shell in running container
    build          Build Docker image
    stop           Stop container
    status         Show container status
    clean          Remove container
    logs           Show container logs
    verify         Verify FINN installation
    health         Check container health
    help           Show this help message

